(7744544, 1277978, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. 7 as is. With a little bit of tweaking it would have been a 9. For some reason, I was perspective correction so that the frame is completely straight on with 90 degree angles. Plus it seems a little underexposed. I like the shadows, but the greys on the right hand side of the frame make it look a little muddy. Really crisp and clean, I feel, would have made this from nice to brilliant.</td>', 'I love the idea. 7 as is. With a little bit of tweaking it would have been a 9. For some reason, I was perspective correction so that the frame is completely straight on with 90 degree angles. Plus it seems a little underexposed. I like the shadows, but the greys on the right hand side of the frame make it look a little muddy. Really crisp and clean, I feel, would have made this from nice to brilliant.', '2023-05-13 10:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
