(7744748, 1277677, 124815, '<td valign="top">Roz only you and Jean-Henri Fabre in your shared passion for insects could call these hairy and spiky things CUTE<br/>Mind you, I liked the shot, as I like pretty much all of your images and I feel like re-designing them to make monsters or fancy broaches in gold and irridiscent stones but , boy, keep them away from me.<br/>As reading on same subject, a few writers can surpass Gerry Durrell in his minutious, humorist and superb English. <br/> <br/>Subject out of frame, yes, yours is one of the best. <br/>Perhaps I shall visit you and some miracles might happen.</td>', 'Roz only you and Jean-Henri Fabre in your shared passion for insects could call these hairy and spiky things CUTEMind you, I liked the shot, as I like pretty much all of your images and I feel like re-designing them to make monsters or fancy broaches in gold and irridiscent stones but , boy, keep them away from me.As reading on same subject, a few writers can surpass Gerry Durrell in his minutious, humorist and superb English.  Subject out of frame, yes, yours is one of the best. Perhaps I shall visit you and some miracles might happen.', '2023-05-15 01:57:19.000000', NULL, 0),
