(7744901, 1277677, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Roz only you and Jean-Henri Fabre in your shared passion for insects could call these hairy and spiky things CUTE<br/>Mind you, I liked the shot, as I like pretty much all of your images and I feel like re-designing them to make monsters or fancy broaches in gold and irridiscent stones but , boy, keep them away from me.<br/>As reading on same subject, a few writers can surpass Gerry Durrell in his minutious, humorist and superb English. <br/> <br/>Subject out of frame, yes, yours is one of the best. <br/>Perhaps I shall visit you and some miracles might happen. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>talk about making my day Mariuca .. a person who is not a fan of insects actually loving this pic .. i''m sure the little fly would say thankyou .. !! .. <br/>and also thankyou .. i learnt a new word .. "minutious" .. i did google it .. and then realized it was a bit self explanatory .. (msg to self .. exercise your brain .. take a minute to actually think before going into google .. ;) .. )<br/> <br/>i would love to see you create broaches from my insects .. take whatever you want .. <br/> <br/>and yes .. visit anytime .. miracles are happening all the time .. its just that we dont always see them .. xx</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Roz only you and Jean-Henri Fabre in your shared passion for insects could call these hairy and spiky things CUTEMind you, I liked the shot, as I like pretty much all of your images and I feel like re-designing them to make monsters or fancy broaches in gold and irridiscent stones but , boy, keep them away from me.As reading on same subject, a few writers can surpass Gerry Durrell in his minutious, humorist and superb English.  Subject out of frame, yes, yours is one of the best. Perhaps I shall visit you and some miracles might happen.   talk about making my day Mariuca .. a person who is not a fan of insects actually loving this pic .. i''m sure the little fly would say thankyou .. !! .. and also thankyou .. i learnt a new word .. "minutious" .. i did google it .. and then realized it was a bit self explanatory .. (msg to self .. exercise your brain .. take a minute to actually think before going into google .. ;) .. ) i would love to see you create broaches from my insects .. take whatever you want ..  and yes .. visit anytime .. miracles are happening all the time .. its just that we dont always see them .. xx', '2023-05-15 17:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
